{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026NbSY4HJSm81794815895.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>股評人鄭家華於節目中推介聯想集團(992)，指股份嚴重超賣，既然人工智能普及化，不可或缺，相信股價在現水平會有吸納。</p><p></p><p>鄭家華原先建議17.48元買入，後來改為節目中的現價16.92元入市，目標價下調至20元，若失守15.98元便止蝕。</p><p></p><p>聯想集團(992)</p><p>股評人買賣策略</p><p>買入：$16.92</p><p>目標：$20</p><p>止蝕：$15.98</p><p></p><p>股評人莫灝楠推介煙草公司菲利普莫里斯(PM)，除了因為AI交易退燒，資金流入必須消費品之外，公司無煙產品收入已擴至佔約四成，而無煙尼古丁袋ZYN仍是美國袋煙龍頭，國際定價能力仍強也是支撐業務表現。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"1325.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026aMpDxkZFpu1794815939.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>莫灝楠認為現價199.99美元便可買入，目標價看220元，止蝕價在188元。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"1326.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026AaUeLwDSxV1794815991.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>菲利普莫里斯(PM)</p><p>股評人買賣策略</p><p>買入：現價→199.99美元</p><p>目標：220美元</p><p>止蝕：188美元</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T08:55:28.761590+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":352,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T07:55:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T06:22:50.386372+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T08:48:41.866661+00:00","content_hash":"6544da65d8e2c8b09c7fa2a3f6b9ae67ca48c1fc28c197accc7bf5600151339f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T08:55:28.761590+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}